# Blazor Components

This directory will contain reusable Blazor components (.razor files).

Example components:
- `CVFormComponent.razor` - Form for entering CV data
- `WorkExperienceCard.razor` - Display work experience entry
- `EducationCard.razor` - Display education entry
- `SkillsList.razor` - Display and manage skills
- `TemplatePreview.razor` - Preview a CV template
